OL,3,GNEWSAJoe Marler 'riding Traitors wave'
OL,4,Aon podcast tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom being known as a traitor hunter to
OL,7,Fpseudo-psychiatrist podcaster Dr Joe,
OL,8,FJoe Marler has come a long way since
OL,9,Fhis days as an England International
OL,10,Frugby player.
OL,12,FHis podcast, Joe Marler Will See You
OL,13,FNow, is about to tour live across
OL,14,FEngland.
OL,16,FSpeaking of his time on The Celebrity
OL,17,FTraitors, Marler, who is from
OL,18,FHeathfield in East Sussex, admitted:
OL,19,F"I've definitely milked it for all it's
OL,20,Fworth - I've ridden that wave."
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
